<![CDATA[<font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">I'm glad that we could connected today. As promised, I wanted to provide you more information on our company that will help you make an informed decision as to whether we are the right company for you.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">I have attached a document titled "Memphis Invest Critical Numbers", which gives a summary of our company data and metrics that we use to judge our own internal performance.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">A second attachment called "Memphis Invest Property Data" gives realistic data on each market that speaks to average prices and rents.</font></div><div><font face="arial">This also shows you the types of properties that you will be adding to your portfolio.</font></div><div><br></div><div><font face="arial">Lastly, I am including a few before and after scopes of work on recently completed properties.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">After you have had a chance to review this information please <a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bdc5-baba97f6-16a5be18-baba97f6-00000002-9ah4ajgjrq1fh0gfu7ukkodpubk11noi&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1">CLICK HERE&nbsp;</a>to set your next call with me so that we can continue to move you along in the process.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">To your success,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div>Marq<br class="Apple-interchange-newline"><br></div>--&nbsp;<br><div class="gmail_signature" data-smartmail="gmail_signature"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><br><div><span style="font-family: georgia, serif; font-size: small; border-collapse: separate;"><div><font color="#000000" face="verdana, sans-serif">